type: software
title: "Gradia: Smarter academic assessment"
abstract: >-
  Gradia is a private, local-first desktop application for flexible academic
  gradebooks, attendance, institute-independent grading and calculations,
  descriptive analytics, administrative progress, and fidelity-preserving
  institutional Excel template export.
